   `CFBundleDisplayName` is the Home Screen label and must stay short: iOS
   strips spaces past ~12 characters, then truncates. The full App Store name
   lives in App Store Connect, not here. */
"CFBundleDisplayName" = "Prayer & Alarm";
"CFBundleName" = "Prayer Times";
"NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription" = "Location access is needed to show prayer times for where you are.";
"NSLocationAlwaysAndWhenInUseUsageDescription" = "Location access is needed to show prayer times for where you are.";
"NSCameraUsageDescription" = "Camera access is needed to scan the code you saved, so you can dismiss an alarm with a QR task.";
"NSAlarmKitUsageDescription" = "Alarm access is needed to set audible alarms for prayer times and the times you choose.";
